{"parentUuid":"d9b8a1b6-3629-4b72-b3dc-b9ea705fb25c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f859c755-da6c-49d3-9404-148b849e4500","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XCEz5KCNWg91NUFAau59Ti","type":"tool_result","content":"Find your first automation clients with Clay: https://makes.clay.com/go/nate-herk/find-your-first-automation-clients?via=nate-herk-int1\nMy playbook for growing a $1M AI agency: https://app.aiautomationsociety.ai/opaa-ads-optin\nMy FREE resources: https://www.skool.com/ai-automation-society/about?el=mark-pod-agent-harnesses&hcategory=youtube-videos&utm_campaign=free-group\n\nMy Tools💻\nFREE MONTH voice to text: https://get.glaido.com/nate\nCode NATEHERK for 10% off VPS (annual plan): https://www.hostinger.com/vps/claude-code-hosting\n\nI sat down with Mark Kashef to talk about how to choose the right AI agent and what matters beyond the model. \n\nWe break down AI harnesses, how we use Claude Code and Codex, and how to keep your skills useful across different tools. We also discuss when to retire old skills and how to keep your AI operating system organized as models improve.\n\nSponsorship Inquiries:\n📧 nate@smoothmedia.co\n\nConnect with me:\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/nateherkelman/\nhttps://x.com/nateherk\nhttps://www.instagram.com/nateherk/\n\nTIMESTAMPS \n0:00 Intro\n2:05 Models vs. Harnesses\n7:19 Local Models in LM Studio\n9:26 Clay Sponsor\n10:29 Choosing and Switching AI Agents\n13:37 Hermes, Ope","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"da52baf9-ad70-4736-81dc-339d4550ca84","timestamp":"2026-09-12T13:35:08.294Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Find your first automation clients with Clay: https://makes.clay.com/go/nate-herk/find-your-first-automation-clients?via=nate-herk-int1\nMy playbook for growing a $1M AI agency: https://app.aiautomationsociety.ai/opaa-ads-optin\nMy FREE resources: https://www.skool.com/ai-automation-society/about?el=mark-pod-agent-harnesses&hcategory=youtube-videos&utm_campaign=free-group\n\nMy Tools💻\nFREE MONTH voice to text: https://get.glaido.com/nate\nCode NATEHERK for 10% off VPS (annual plan): https://www.hostinger.com/vps/claude-code-hosting\n\nI sat down with Mark Kashef to talk about how to choose the right AI agent and what matters beyond the model. \n\nWe break down AI harnesses, how we use Claude Code and Codex, and how to keep your skills useful across different tools. We also discuss when to retire old skills and how to keep your AI operating system organized as models improve.\n\nSponsorship Inquiries:\n📧 nate@smoothmedia.co\n\nConnect with me:\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/nateherkelman/\nhttps://x.com/nateherk\nhttps://www.instagram.com/nateherk/\n\nTIMESTAMPS \n0:00 Intro\n2:05 Models vs. Harnesses\n7:19 Local Models in LM Studio\n9:26 Clay Sponsor\n10:29 Choosing and Switching AI Agents\n13:37 Hermes, Ope","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d9b8a1b6-3629-4b72-b3dc-b9ea705fb25c","session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
