{"parentUuid":"8c63c7bf-c034-4c82-9bd1-76082dc07e98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyfaMfBHq1BmcWrArNeL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"160 → 60 skills. **~12,800 tokens back every session.** Writing the audit report."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1183,"cache_read_input_tokens":165932,"output_tokens":3758,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":707},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1183,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3758,"cache_read_input_tokens":165932,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1183},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeyfaJxD2C644GLxr3y1Y","attributionSkill":"memory-write","type":"assistant","uuid":"5ce69354-f4ae-4403-a00c-ed571911c007","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:00:18.160Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"5ce69354-f4ae-4403-a00c-ed571911c007","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyfaMfBHq1BmcWrArNeL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018AoSmu8K7KzTiU7EdDhfBv","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/SecondBrain/Inbox/2026-09-12-skill-audit.md","content":"---\ntitle: \"Skill audit 2026-09-12 — 160 global skills down to 60\"\ndate: 2026-09-12\ntype: audit\ntrigger: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6LNlCpQPYFc\nrelated: 2026-09-12-harness-over-model-mark-kashef.md\nscript: ~/.claude/skills-audit-2026-09-12.sh\ntags: [skills, context-engineering, claude-code, audit]\n---\n\n# Skill audit — 2026-09-12\n\nTriggered by the Mark Kashef / Nate Herk harness video. Companion note:\n`2026-09-12-harness-over-model-mark-kashef.md`.\n\n## The bill\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Global skills in `~/.claude/skills/` | **160** |\n| — of which are symlinks into `~/.agents/skills/` | 45 |\n| Plugin skills installed | 606 |\n| Project-level skills anywhere in `~/DEV` | **0** |\n| Distinct skills ever invoked (414 sessions) | **58** |\n| Used 3+ times | 30 |\n| Never used at all | **130** |\n| **Context cost of the skill roster, every session** | **~19,158 tokens** |\n\nThat last row is the real cost. Every skill's name and description is loaded into\ncontext at session start whether you use it or not. 19k tokens is the standing tax.\n\n## The rule applied\n\nThe video's audit question is not *\"how often did I run this?\"* It is:\n\n> **\"Would the model do this fine without the skill now?\"**\n\nA skill is a crutch. As the brain gets smarter, the crutch starts to limit it.\nSo the keep/cut split below is by **category**, not by usage count.\n\n## Verified before cutting\n\n- `interceptor`, `firecrawl`, `playwright`, `bright-data`, `apify` — **all missing\n  from PATH.** Those skills can never fire successfully. Pure dead weight.\n- **45 skills are symlinks** into `~/.agents/skills/`, the folder Codex and Cowork\n  also read. Archiving a symlink de-registers it from Claude Code and **leaves the\n  real skill intact for Codex.** That is the desired behaviour, not a side effect.\n  (Related: `project_vendored-skill-install`, `project_vendored-skill-repair`.)\n- 13 skills were installed in the last 14 days. They get a grace period — too new\n  to judge. Not in any cut tier.\n\n## The tiers\n\n### Tier 1 — dead weight (43 skills, ~6,663 tokens)\n\nHighest confidence. No judgment calls.\n\n- **Broken tools (9):** `Interceptor` `Browser` `playwright-cli` `firecrawl`\n  `firecrawl-build-onboarding` `BrightData` `Apify` `web-scraping` `everything-search`\n  — binaries not installed.\n- **Generic thinking / prompt skills (21):** `caveman` `zoom-out` `roast` `BeCreative`\n  `Ideate` `FirstPrinciples` `SystemsThinking` `Aphorisms` `Prompting` `BiasCheck`\n  `IterativeDepth` `ApertureOscillation` `BitterPillEngineering` `ExtractWisdom`\n  `Council` `grill-me` `grill-with-docs` `backtrack` `fact-checker` `Fabric`\n  — this is *exactly* the category the video says to delete. Opus 5 does these natively.\n- **Not your domain (13):** `pp-flight-goat` `pp-movie-goat` `pp-recipe-goat` `Sales`\n  `starter-icp-positioning` `starter-voice-profile` `USMetrics` `WorldThreatModel`\n  `RedTeam` `PrivateInvestigator` `Art` `AudioEditor` `Remotion` `WriteStory`\n\n### Tier 2 — superseded (57 skills, ~6,137 tokens)\n\nYou already use something that covers each of these. Contains judgment calls —\nreview before running.\n\n- **Skill authoring** — `CreateSkill` (22 uses) covers: `write-a-skill`\n  `writing-great-skills` `skill-evaluator` `find-skills`\n- **Matt Pocock duplicates** — you invoke the `mattpocock-skills:*` plugin versions;\n  these are stale local copies: `ask-matt` `setup-matt-pocock-skills` `codebase-design`\n  `diagnosing-bugs` `domain-modeling` `tdd` `research`\n- **Design pile** — `impeccable` (6) + `artifact-design` (8) cover: `gpt-taste`\n  `high-end-visual-design` `image-to-code` `imagegen-frontend-*` `industrial-brutalist-ui`\n  `minimalist-ui` `redesign-existing-projects` `stitch-design-taste` `design-academy-skill`\n  `design-taste-frontend-v1` `starter-design-tokens` `brandkit` `Webdesign`\n  `frontend-slides` `visual-explainer` `diagram-generator`\n- **Workflow pile** — `superpowers:*` + `claudex-*` cover: `to-prd` `to-spec` `to-tickets`\n  `triage` `implement` `wayfinder` `improve-codebase-architecture` `RootCauseAnalysis`\n  `loop-designer` `Loop` `Delegation` `Migrate` `Optimize` `Hardening` `decision-toolkit`\n  `CreateCLI` `Agents` `Evals` `ContextSearch` `Daemon` `LocalIntelligence` `Knowledge`\n  `Interview` `process-interviewer` `research-assistant` `storm-research`\n  `full-output-enforcement` `fable-mode` `Telos`\n\n### Keep — tacit knowledge, even at zero uses\n\nThese carry knowledge the model can never have. The video is explicit that this is\nthe one category worth keeping forever.\n\n`game-film-timestamps` (Hudl/DVSport/ESPN timestamp repair) ·\n`pp-catapult-openfield-connect` (GPS) · `pp-zotero-research-library` ·\n`five-slides-generator` (your Baylor deck format) · `pp-fireflies`\n\n### Grace period — installed in the last 14 days\n\n`new-project` `brain-audit` `codex-build` `claudex-route` `claudex-loop`\n`next-decision` `decisions` `before-building` `anti-sleep` `persistent-localhost`\n`session-miner` `improve-system` `design-taste-frontend-v1`\n\n### Your call — not cut, not defended\n\n`pbir-report-builder` (Power BI / IBCS — plausibly useful for Baylor reporting,\nunused 47 days) · `Science` · `ArXiv` · `pp-espn` · `weekly-review` ·\n`ingest-resource` · `library-advisor` · `library-review` · `capture-insight` ·\n`scroll-craft`\n\n## Result\n\n| Stage | Skills | Roster cost | Per-session tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Now | 160 | 76,632 ch | ~19,158 |\n| After Tier 1 | 117 | 49,980 ch | ~12,495 |\n| After Tier 2 | **60** | 25,430 ch | **~6,357** |\n\n**~12,800 tokens back every session — a 66% cut.**\n\n## How to run it\n\nThe script **archives, never deletes.** Everything moves to\n`~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/`.\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.claude/skills-audit-2026-09-12.sh dryrun   # show, move nothing\nbash ~/.claude/skills-audit-2026-09-12.sh tier1\nbash ~/.claude/skills-audit-2026-09-12.sh tier2\n```\n\nUndo, any time:\n\n```bash\nmv ~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/<name> ~/.claude/skills/   # one skill\nmv ~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/* ~/.claude/skills/        # all of them\n```\n\nThen `/reload-skills` or start a new session.\n\n## Next steps after this\n\n1. **Promotion rule.** You have 0 project-level skills. New skills start in\n   `<project>/.claude/skills/` and only move to global once they prove out across\n   2+ projects. See `project_skill-bloat-and-promotion`.\n2. **Plugin side.** 606 plugin skills are still untouched — that is a separate pass,\n   done by uninstalling whole plugins rather than individual skills.\n3. **Put it on a clock.** Monthly skill audit, weekly rules review. The decay table\n   is in the companion note.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1183,"cache_read_input_tokens":165932,"output_tokens":3758,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":707},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1183,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3758,"cache_read_input_tokens":165932,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1183},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CeyfaJxD2C644GLxr3y1Y","attributionSkill":"memory-write","type":"assistant","uuid":