{"parentUuid":"aefd2fb0-c034-4add-9408-7e1178d5a6a1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ceyg26wsHYQYDxrEKgkQN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QnnpZfK4GHRTH9b7ehnfsi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash\npython3 - <<'PY'\nedits=[\n (\"SecondBrain/Inbox/2026-09-12-skill-audit.md\",\n  [(\"### Tier 2 — superseded (57 skills, ~6,137 tokens)\",\n    \"### Tier 2 — superseded (56 skills, ~6,137 tokens)\"),\n   (\"  `minimalist-ui` `redesign-existing-projects` `stitch-design-taste` `design-academy-skill`\\n  `design-taste-frontend-v1` `starter-design-tokens` `brandkit` `Webdesign`\",\n    \"  `minimalist-ui` `redesign-existing-projects` `stitch-design-taste` `design-academy-skill`\\n  `starter-design-tokens` `brandkit` `Webdesign`\"),\n   (\"| After Tier 2 | **60** | 25,430 ch | **~6,357** |\",\n    \"| After Tier 2 | **61** | 25,430 ch | **~6,357** |\")]),\n (\".claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md\",\n  [(\"| Global skills in `~/.claude/skills/` | 164 |\",\n    \"| Global skills in `~/.claude/skills/` | 160 (→ **117** after the Tier 1 archive, 2026-09-12) |\"),\n   (\"| Exposed to one session's roster | ~120 |\\n\",\"\")]),\n]\nfor p,subs in edits:\n    t=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\n    for o,n in subs:\n        assert o in t, f\"MISS {p}: {o[:50]}\"\n        t=t.replace(o,n,1)\n    open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(t); print(\"fixed:\",p)\nPY\necho \"--- append audit outcome to memory ---\"\ncat >> /Users/kristinarash/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Audit outcome, 2026-09-12\n\nTier 1 executed: **43 skills archived**, global 160 → 117, roster cost 19,158 →\n12,495 tokens/session. Zero regressions — none of the 43 had ever been invoked.\nTier 2 (56 more, ~6.1k tokens) is written but **not run**.\n\nScript: `~/.claude/skills-audit-2026-09-12.sh` (archives, never deletes — undo with\n`mv ~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/* ~/.claude/skills/`).\nReport: `~/SecondBrain/Inbox/2026-09-12-skill-audit.md`.\n\nThree traps found while doing it:\n1. **`~/.claude/skills/` is gitignored** inside the `dotclaude` repo — git is NOT a\n   safety net for skills. The archive-move is the only undo.\n2. **45 of the 160 skills are symlinks** into `~/.agents/skills/`. Archiving a symlink\n   de-registers it from Claude Code but leaves the real copy for Codex. Count with\n   `find -L`; plain `find` undercounts by 45.\n3. **\"606 plugin skills\" is cache, not load.** Only 6 of 24 plugins are enabled\n   (~37 skills exposed). The rest are disabled plugins and old cached versions.\nEOF\nwc -c < /Users/kristinarash/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md","description":"Final corrections and memory outcome"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":705,"cache_read_input_tokens":195146,"output_tokens":1279,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":705,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1279,"cache_read_input_tokens":195146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":705,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":705},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ceyg26Ayk7QNwMR2JnKAc","attributionSkill":"memory-write","type":"assistant","uuid":"161cf734-0fff-479b-b526-ada4349a10a9","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:06:08.140Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645c