e/skills/` | **160** → now **61** |')\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(t); print(\"audit report updated\")\n\nm=\".claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md\"\nt=open(m,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold2=\"\"\"Tier 1 executed: **43 skills archived**, global 160 → 117, roster cost 19,158 →\n12,495 tokens/session. Zero regressions — none of the 43 had ever been invoked.\nTier 2 (56 more, ~6.1k tokens) is written but **not run**.\"\"\"\nnew2=\"\"\"**Both tiers executed.** 99 skills archived, global **160 → 61**, roster cost\n**19,158 → 6,428 tokens/session (a 66% cut)**. Zero regressions: none of the 99\nhad ever been invoked in 414 sessions.\n\nDecision 2026-09-12: keep the `mattpocock-skills` and `superpowers` **plugins** and\narchive the local bare-name duplicates. The plugin (v1.2.3, 35 skills) ships every\nduplicate removed and is newer than the July symlinks. Rule that follows: when a\nplugin and a local skill share a name, **the plugin wins** — delete the local copy.\"\"\"\nassert old2 in t\nopen(m,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(t.replace(old2,new2,1)); print(\"memory updated\")\n\ng=\".claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md\"\nt=open(g,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold3=\"- **Skill audit (9/12)**: Tier1 DONE (160→117 global skills, ~6.7k tok/session back). Tier2 (57) pending. →Tier A skill-bloat-and-promotion\"\nnew3=\"- **Skill audit (9/12)**: DONE. 160→61 global skills, 19.2k→6.4k tok/session. Plugins beat local copies. →Tier A skill-bloat-and-promotion\"\nassert old3 in t\nopen(g,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(t.replace(old3,new3,1))\nprint(\"global memory updated, size:\", len(open(g,encoding='utf-8').read().encode()), \"/2500\")\nPY","description":"Update audit record and memory with tier 2 result"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":213753,"output_tokens":2055,"output_toke