{"parentUuid":"cfc65fed-6174-4c12-afcf-6b468c2b5809","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"11a6ada2-1325-409e-a2ef-4046c9c2c771","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015q8MjwGd7qMfXbQXEvjod2","type":"tool_result","content":"# Claude Pro/Max Subscription Usage\n\nHere's what the page states about Claude Pro/Max billing:\n\n\"Anthropic subscription auth is active for Claude Pro/Max accounts. Third-party harness usage draws from [extra usage](https://claude.ai/settings/usage) and is billed per token, not against Claude plan limits.\"\n\nThis indicates that when using Pi with a Claude Pro/Max subscription, charges for third-party tool usage come from your extra usage quota rather than consuming your standard plan allowance, with per-token billing applied.\n\n# ChatGPT Plus/Pro Subscription\n\nRegarding OpenAI's offering, the page only specifies the requirement: \"Requires ChatGPT Plus or Pro subscription.\" It provides no details about billing or usage mechanics for that service."}]},"uuid":"b070aeb0-b357-4485-8e91-f2b4abfe9a13","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:49:39.344Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":14389,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Claude Pro/Max Subscription Usage\n\nHere's what the page states about Claude Pro/Max billing:\n\n\"Anthropic subscription auth is active for Claude Pro/Max accounts. Third-party harness usage draws from [extra usage](https://claude.ai/settings/usage) and is billed per token, not against Claude plan limits.\"\n\nThis indicates that when using Pi with a Claude Pro/Max subscription, charges for third-party tool usage come from your extra usage quota rather than consuming your standard plan allowance, with per-token billing applied.\n\n# ChatGPT Plus/Pro Subscription\n\nRegarding OpenAI's offering, the page only specifies the requirement: \"Requires ChatGPT Plus or Pro subscription.\" It provides no details about billing or usage mechanics for that service.","durationMs":3368,"url":"https://pi.dev/docs/latest/providers"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cfc65fed-6174-4c12-afcf-6b468c2b5809","session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
