{"parentUuid":"68331c76-0515-47a7-80a4-f627476d95d3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyjMoiCCdm6xDjP8DM9Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TWGFcUZjTsDZuzm8bBZYKu","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11145838-using-claude-code-with-your-pro-or-max-plan","prompt":"What does the Claude Pro/Max plan cover? Which surfaces use subscription limits vs API/extra usage billing? Does non-interactive use (claude -p, headless, GitHub Actions, Agent SDK) count against the plan or bill separately? What about third-party tools using subscription auth?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2533,"cache_read_input_tokens":237538,"output_tokens":1036,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":739},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2533,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1036,"cache_read_input_tokens":237538,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2533},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeyjMnynA2GP83TH6V52n","type":"assistant","uuid":"82d5c857-a87d-41cf-af76-6351df439167","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:49:55.277Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"82d5c857-a87d-41cf-af76-6351df439167","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyjMoiCCdm6xDjP8DM9Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018k9cYUwPE9XX1NjSwSvC4S","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Claude Code subscription vs extra usage \"claude -p\" headless Agent SDK credit Pro Max 2026 which surfaces covered"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2533,"cache_read_input_tokens":237538,"output_tokens":1036,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":739},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2533,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1036,"cache_read_input_tokens":237538,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2533},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CeyjMnynA2GP83TH6V52n","type":"assistant","uuid":"66b3e929-da08-4bfe-98f3-2c0cf1afb731","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:49:56.081Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"82d5c857-a87d-41cf-af76-6351df439167","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"11a6ada2-1325-409e-a2ef-4046c9c2c771","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TWGFcUZjTsDZuzm8bBZYKu","type":"tool_result","content":"# Claude Pro/Max Plan Coverage & Billing\n\n## What's Covered\n\nPro and Max plans provide unified access to:\n- Claude on web, desktop, and mobile apps\n- Claude Code in terminal and supported IDEs (VS Code, Cursor, JetBrains)\n\n\"all activity in both tools counts against the same usage limits\"\n\n## Subscription vs. API Billing\n\n**Subscription limits apply to:**\n- Interactive Claude use (web/mobile/desktop)\n- Claude Code terminal and IDE usage\n- All count toward shared monthly allocation\n\n**API billing (separate):**\nIf you authenticate Claude Code with an API key instead of subscription credentials, usage charges apply at standard API rates rather than consuming your plan allocation.\n\n## Non-Interactive Use\n\nThe documentation doesn't explicitly detail GitHub Actions or headless usage billing. However, it notes: \"If you have an ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable set on your system, Claude Code will use this API key for authentication instead of your Claude subscription...resulting in API usage charges.\"\n\nThis suggests non-interactive automation defaulting to API keys incurs separate billing unless explicitly configured with subscription authentication.\n\n## Third-Party Tools\n\nThe guide doesn't specifically address third-party integrations using subscription auth. The billing structure appears designed for direct Anthropic clients (web, desktop, IDE) rather than third-party intermediaries."}]},"uuid":"456b1088-39b8-4cc8-8990-cd8cd47f9b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:50:01.988Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":363270,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Claude Pro/Max Plan Coverage & Billing\n\n## What's Covered\n\nPro and Max plans provide unified access to:\n- Claude on web, desktop, and mobile apps\n- Claude Code in terminal and supported IDEs (VS Code, Cursor, JetBrains)\n\n\"all activity in both tools counts against the same usage limits\"\n\n## Subscription vs. API Billing\n\n**Subscription limits apply to:**\n- Interactive Claude use (web/mobile/desktop)\n- Claude Code terminal and IDE usage\n- All count toward shared monthly allocation\n\n**API billing (separate):**\nIf you authenticate Claude Code with an API key instead of subscription credentials, usage charges apply at standard API rates rather than consuming your plan allocation.\n\n## Non-Interactive Use\n\nThe documentation doesn't explicitly detail GitHub Actions or headless usage billing. However, it notes: \"If you have an ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable set on your system, Claude Code will use this API key for authentication instead of your Claude subscription...resulting in API usage charges.\"\n\nThis suggests non-interactive automation defaulting to API keys incurs separate billing unless explicitly configured with subscription authentication.\n\n## Third-Party Tools\n\nThe guide doesn't specifically address third-party integrations using subscription auth. The billing structure appears designed for direct Anthropic clients (web, desktop, IDE) rather than third-party intermediaries.","durationMs":5431,"url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11145838-using-claude-code-with-your-pro-or-max-plan"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"82d5c857-a87d-41cf-af76-6351df439167","session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"66b3e929-da08-4bfe-98f3-2c0cf1afb731","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"11a6ada2-1325-409e-a2ef-4046c9c2c771","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018k9cYUwPE9XX1NjSwSvC4S","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code subscription vs extra usage \"claude -p\" headless Agent SDK credit Pro Max 2026 which surfaces covered\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What Anthropic's New Claude Billing Means for Zed Users — Zed's Blog\",\"url\":\"https://zed.dev/blog/anthropic-subscription-changes\"},{\"title\":\"Use the Claude Agent SDK with your Claude plan | Claude Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15036540-use-the-claude-agent-sdk-with-your-claude-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Claude's Billing Changes: What Breaks, and How to Keep Your AI Agents & Automations Free\",\"url\":\"https://genaiunplugged.substack.com/p/claude-billing-change-workarounds-free-ai-automations\"},{\"title\":\"Claude's $200 Agent SDK Credit: Who Wins on June 15?\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/development/agent-sdk-credit\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Agent SDK Credits End the Subscription Arbitrage - Developers Digest\",\"url\":\"https://www.developersdigest.tech/blog/claude-agent-sdk-credit-meter\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Billing & Monthly Credit Pools (2026)\",\"url\":\"https://tygartmedia.com/claude-code-billing-credit-pool-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Ends Subscription Subsidy for Agents June 15: Credit Pool Replaces Flat-Rate Access\",\"url\":\"https://www.techtimes.com/articles/317625/20260602/anthropic-ends-subscription-subsidy-agents-june-15-credit-pool-replaces-flat-rate-access.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Agent SDK Credits in 2026: What Changes June 15 for Builders - Totalum Blog\",\"url\":\"https://www.totalum.app/blog/claude-agent-sdk-credits-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Agent SDK in 2026: Complete Guide to Plans, Credits, and Shipping to Production - Totalum Blog\",\"url\":\"https://www.totalum.app/blog/claude-agent-sdk-totalum-2026\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what's covered by Claude subscription vs. extra usage with respect to Claude Code, the `claude -p` headless command, and the Agent SDK credit:\n\n## Agent SDK Credit Coverage (As of June 15, 2026)\n\nThe Agent SDK credit covers Claude Agent SDK usage, the `claude -p` command, and third-party apps built on the Agent SDK. More specifically, the new separate credit pool covers four specific surfaces: the Claude Agent SDK in Python or TypeScript projects; `claude -p`, the non-interactive headless mode used in scripts and cron jobs; the Claude Code GitHub Actions integration; and third-party applications that authenticate with a Claude subscription through the Agent SDK.\n\n## Credit Amounts by Plan\n\nPro gets $20, Max 5x gets $100, and Max 20x gets $200.\n\n## How Extra Usage Works\n\nAgent SDK usage draws from your monthly credit before any other source. When your monthly credit runs out, additional Agent SDK usage flows to usage credits at standard API rates—but only if you've enabled usage credits. If usage credits aren't enabled, Agent SDK requests stop until your credit refreshes.\n\n## What's NOT Affected\n\nChat on the web, desktop, or mobile apps; Claude Code used interactively in the terminal or an IDE; and Claude Cowork all continue drawing from the same subscription usage limits as before.\n\n**Note:** As of June 16, 2026, Anthropic announced that the billing change is not taking effect yet. For now, Agent SDK usage, `claude -p`, and third-party apps built on the Agent SDK continue to work with Claude subscriptions exactly as they did before, with no separate Agent SDK credit to claim.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"95e101e2-bba4-44a9-9e7c-d2303b45d675","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:50:06.045Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Claude Code subscription vs extra usage \"claude -p\" headless Agent SDK credit Pro Max 2026 which surfaces covered","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01LQ9RzYsz4YYFts49Vw5CWt","content":[{"title":"What Anthropic's New Claude Billing Means for Zed Users — Zed's Blog","url":"https://zed.dev/blog/anthropic-subscription-changes"},{"title":"Use the Claude Agent SDK with your Claude plan | Claude Help Center","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15036540-use-the-claude-agent-sdk-with-your-claude-plan"},{"title":"Claude's Billing Changes: What Breaks, and How to Keep Your AI Agents & Automations Free","url":"https://genaiunplugged.substack.com/p/claude-billing-change-workarounds-free-ai-automations"},{"title":"Claude's $200 Agent SDK Credit: Who Wins on June 15?","url":"https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/development/agent-sdk-credit"},{"title":"Claude Agent SDK Credits End the Subscription Arbitrage - Developers Digest","url":"https://www.developersdigest.tech/blog/claude-agent-sdk-credit-meter"},{"title":"Claude Code Billing & Monthly Credit Pools (2026)","url":"https://tygartmedia.com/claude-code-billing-credit-pool-2026/"},{"title":"Anthropic Ends Subscription Subsidy for Agents June 15: Credit Pool Replaces Flat-Rate Access","url":"https://www.techtimes.com/articles/317625/20260602/anthropic-ends-subscription-subsidy-agents-june-15-credit-pool-replaces-flat-rate-access.htm"},{"title":"Claude Agent SDK Credits in 2026: What Changes June 15 for Builders - Totalum Blog","url":"https://www.totalum.app/blog/claude-agent-sdk-credits-2026"},{"title":"Claude Agent SDK in 2026: Complete Guide to Plans, Credits, and Shipping to Production - Totalum Blog","url":"https://www.totalum.app/blog/claude-agent-sdk-totalum-2026"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what's covered by Claude subscription vs. extra usage with respect to Claude Code, the `claude -p` headless command, and the Agent SDK credit:\n\n## Agent SDK Credit Coverage (As of June 15, 2026)\n\nThe Agent SDK credit covers Claude Agent SDK usage, the `claude -p` command, and third-party apps built on the Agent SDK. More specifically, the new separate credit pool covers four specific surfaces: the Claude Agent SDK in Python or TypeScript projects; `claude -p`, the non-interactive headless mode used in scripts and cron jobs; the Claude Code GitHub Actions integration; and third-party applications that authenticate with a Claude subscription through the Agent SDK.\n\n## Credit Amounts by Plan\n\nPro gets $20, Max 5x gets $100, and Max 20x gets $200.\n\n## How Extra Usage Works\n\nAgent SDK usage draws from your monthly credit before any other source. When your monthly credit runs out, additional Agent SDK usage flows to usage credits at standard API rates—but only if you've enabled usage credits. If usage credits aren't enabled, Agent SDK requests stop until your credit refreshes.\n\n## What's NOT Affected\n\nChat on the web, desktop, or mobile apps; Claude Code used interactively in the terminal or an IDE; and Claude Cowork all continue drawing from the same subscription usage limits as before.\n\n**Note:** As of June 16, 2026, Anthropic announced that the billing change is not taking effect yet. For now, Agent SDK usage, `claude -p`, and third-party apps built on the Agent SDK continue to work with Claude subscriptions exactly as they did before, with no separate Agent SDK credit to claim."],"durationSeconds":8.387373250000179,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"66b3e929-da08-4bfe-98f3-2c0cf1afb731","session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
