{"parentUuid":"17a72936-d7bb-482e-8f2e-29f46e677175","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyjPYZR4m8YcqVefTr4W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3152,"cache_read_input_tokens":240071,"output_tokens":1858,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":995},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1858,"cache_read_input_tokens":240071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CeyjPXomq9skr8XGNdmVN","type":"assistant","uuid":"9b142617-d5c7-40fc-a82f-f5f10986f81f","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:50:19.514Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"9b142617-d5c7-40fc-a82f-f5f10986f81f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyjPYZR4m8YcqVefTr4W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short answer: **almost — but the line is \"first-party and interactive\", not \"Claude Code\" exactly.**\n\n## Covered by your subscription\n\nConfirmed by Anthropic's own help page:\n\n- Claude on web, desktop, mobile\n- **Claude Code in the terminal and supported IDEs** (VS Code, Cursor, JetBrains)\n- Claude Cowork\n\nTheir words: *\"all activity in both tools counts against the same usage limits.\"*\n\n## Not covered — billed per token instead\n\n- **Third-party harnesses** using your Claude login (Pi, OpenClaw, etc). Anthropic cut these off from plan limits on **4 April 2026**. They now draw from \"extra usage\" at API rates.\n- **Claude Code itself, if you set `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`.** That env var overrides your subscription and bills the API. Worth knowing — it is an easy accident.\n\n## One part I am not certain about\n\nHeadless use (`claude -p`, cron jobs, GitHub Actions, Agent SDK) was supposed to move to a separate credit pool on 15 June 2026. Anthropic then **paused that change** on 16 June. I could not confirm today's status from an Anthropic page.\n\nSo treat the Pi warning as solid, and treat the headless question as open.\n\n## How to check for yourself\n\nYour usage page is the truth, not my summary:\n\n**https://claude.ai/settings/usage**\n\nIt shows plan usage and extra usage separately. If you trial Pi, look there after — you will see instantly which bucket it landed in.\n\nAnd check this on your machine, since it silently changes the answer:\n\n```\necho \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=${ANTHROPIC_API_KEY:-(not set)}\"\n```\n\nIf it prints a key, your Claude Code is billing the API, not your plan.\n\nSources: [Anthropic — using Claude Code with Pro/Max](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11145838-using-claude-code-with-your-pro-or-max-plan) · [Anthropic — Agent SDK with your Claude plan](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15036540-use-the-claude-agent-sdk-with-your-claude-plan) · [VentureBeat on the third-party harness change](https://venturebeat.com/technology/anthropic-reinstates-openclaw-and-third-party-agent-usage-on-claude-subscriptions-with-a-catch) · [Zed on the billing changes](https://zed.dev/blog/anthropic-subscription-changes)\n\nWant me to run that env check and add this billing note to the Pi research file?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3152,"cache_read_input_tokens":240071,"output_tokens":1858,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":995},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1858,"cache_read_input_tokens":240071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeyjPXomq9skr8XGNdmVN","type":"assistant","uuid":"489c6ef8-79d9-4997-b93a-257887bbd493","timestamp":"2026-09-12T14:50:29.789Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
