{"parentUuid":"55d475a1-643b-48a3-9583-c88b16a1e1a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeymKebC4p6DDmAJ3JWYD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10942,"cache_read_input_tokens":245081,"output_tokens":1301,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":872},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10942,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":245081,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10942},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CeymKdPFmxFDbmsh18mTN","type":"assistant","uuid":"82cbf161-d2d6-4669-b77c-e97140890569","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:15:40.973Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"f1097c6d-9db5-4bb5-a0f7-c42d645cf75d","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"82cbf161-d2d6-4669-b77c-e97140890569","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeymKebC4p6DDmAJ3JWYD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good plan — and Pi's own docs back it up.\n\nOn Pi's providers page, the two subscription lines read differently:\n\n- **Claude Pro/Max** — carries an explicit warning: *\"billed per token, not against Claude plan limits.\"*\n- **ChatGPT Plus/Pro** — no warning at all. Just *\"Requires ChatGPT Plus or Pro subscription.\"*\n\nSo Pi flags the Anthropic catch and not the OpenAI one. That fits what you are doing.\n\nOne honest caveat: no warning is not the same as proof it is free. OpenAI could change this the way Anthropic did in April. Check your OpenAI billing page after the first real session, and you will know for sure.\n\nYour setup then looks like:\n- **Claude Code** → Claude, on your subscription\n- **Pi** → Codex, on your ChatGPT subscription\n- Neither one billing you per token\n\nThat is the anti-tribal thing from the video, done cheaply.\n\nresult: Confirmed Pi's docs warn about per-token billing only for Claude Pro/Max, not for ChatGPT Plus/Pro — supporting the plan to run Codex through the ChatGPT subscription inside Pi, with the caveat that absence of a warning is not a guarantee and OpenAI billing should be checked after the first session."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10942,"cache_read_input_tokens":245081,"output_tokens":1301,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":872},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10942,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":245081,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_inpu